# Vinereap Mentor: "When this creature enters or dies, create a Food token." One Food as it enters. Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills
# Bot1's Ornithopter first: another creature dying creates nothing (CR 603.2, 603.10a: the ability looks back only at the Mentor's
# own death), the Food count stays 1. The second Bolt kills the Mentor and its death creates the second Food (CR 111.10b).

